	// MergeSegmentsWithBodyWithResponse Merge adjacent segments
	//
	// Merges 2-20 adjacent segments into the earliest one (server-ordered by start): texts joined with a space, times spanning all, variants cleared, audio dropped, the others deleted; retranslates by default.
